<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney cuts St Paul.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney cuts St Paul.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Ron Frank cut the firm's rating of St. Paul Cos Inc to neutral from buy, according to the analyst's office.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the liability insurer and wholesale broker slipped 1/2 to 73-3/4.</p>
<p>-- The company said in late April it expects damage from flooding in Minnesota and North Dakota to results in pretax catastrophe losses of $30 to $40 million in the second quarter.</p>
</text>
